dúvida, ficamos à disposição!', 139.99, 139.99, NULL, 'Sports & Outdoors > Sports & Outdoor Recreation Equipments > Cycling', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rccy-ls1likjyxaki42', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F369650932%2F18599201023', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
