as 8h00 18h00. - Fechamos para almoco das 12h00 13h15.', 77.08, 77.08, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > External Parts', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdyv-mbqx4urq3hb965', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1356916980%2F22098712886', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
